(91: (meta: (t: semantic) (n: 1) (term: string%20value) (def: %23%23%20Summary%0A%0ACloses%20%2351.%0A%0AAdds%20an%20end-to-end%20pipeline%20that%20keeps%20every%20preview%20image%20in%20the%20repo%20current%20at%20each%20release%2C%20with%20%2A%2Azero%20manual%20recapture%2A%2A%2C%20driven%20by%20%5B%60browser-commander%60%5D%28https%3A%2F%2Fwww.npmjs.com%2Fpackage%2Fbrowser-commander%29%20as%20the%20issue%20requested.%0A%0A-%20%2A%2A%60scripts%2Fupdate-preview-images.mjs%60%2A%2A%20%28new%29%3A%20builds%20the%20renderer%2C%20serves%20it%20from%20a%20local%20static%20HTTP%20server%2C%20and%20uses%20%60browser-commander%60%20%2B%20Playwright%20to%20recapture%20the%20four%20locale%20%C3%97%20theme%20tiles%20%2B%20the%20share-image%20fallback%20%2B%20the%20README%20landing%20screenshot.%0A-%20%2A%2A%60preview-regen%60%20job%2A%2A%20in%20%60.github%2Fworkflows%2Fjs.yml%60%20%28new%29%3A%20runs%20on%20push%20to%20%60main%60%2C%20on%20release%20tag%20pushes%20%28%60refs%2Ftags%2Fv%2A%60%29%2C%20and%20on%20%60workflow_dispatch%60%20with%20%60release_mode%3Dchecks%60.%20Commits%20any%20drift%20back%20to%20%60main%60%20with%20%60%5Bskip%20ci%5D%60.%0A-%20%2A%2A%60fix%28renderer%29%3A%20hoist%20flushSave%2FapplyAndSave%60%2A%2A%20in%20%60electron%2Frenderer%2FApp.jsx%60%3A%20pre-existing%20temporal-dead-zone%20bug%20that%20prevented%20the%20renderer%20from%20rendering%20at%20all%20when%20the%20bundle%20was%20loaded%20outside%20Electron.%20Blocking%20for%20the%20screenshot%20pipeline%3B%20in%20scope%20for%20%2351.%0A-%20%2A%2A%60docs%2Fcase-studies%2Fissue-51%2F%60%2A%2A%3A%20full%20inventory%2C%20root-cause%20analysis%2C%20link-foundation%20template%20parity%20survey%2C%20and%20acceptance%20criteria.%0A%0A%23%23%20What%20the%20new%20script%20does%0A%0A%7C%20Surface%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%20File%20regenerated%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7C%20Strategy%20%20%20%20%2